PLACEHOLDER - this is NOT a real keytab.
Replace this file with the real one for the qa environment's bind
account (XAAMMQAS), generated via:

  ktutil
  addent -password -p XAAMMQAS@QA.PNCINT.NET -k <kvno> -e aes128-cts-hmac-sha1-96 -s "QA.PNCINT.NETXAAMMQAS"
  addent -password -p XAAMMQAS@QA.PNCINT.NET -k <kvno> -e aes256-cts-hmac-sha1-96 -s "QA.PNCINT.NETXAAMMQAS"
  wkt ad-bind-qa.dat
  quit

Use the actual current kvno for XAAMMQAS (don't assume it matches another
environment's account). Keep the filename ad-bind-qa.dat (or update
mrg_dual_auth_static_keytab_filename_map in vars/main.yml if you rename it).
